occurrences by the total number of trials."},{"Ar":"$24/80=0.3$","En":"$24/80=0.3$"},{"Ar":"نحوّل التكرار النسبي 0.3 إلى نسبة مئوية.","En":"Convert the relative frequency 0.3 to a percentage."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$30\\%$","En":"$30\\%$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تضع إشارة المئة على عدد مرات الظهور مباشرة.","En":"Do not append a percent sign directly to the occurrence count."},"FormulaLatex":"p_{\\%}=\\frac{k}{n}\\cdot100\\%,\\quad n>0","Substitution":{"Ar":"$0.3\\cdot100\\%=30\\%$","En":"$0.3\\cdot100\\%=30\\%$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$80\\cdot0.30=24$","En":"$80\\cdot0.30=24$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"24% يخلط العدد المشاهد بالنسبة المئوية.","En":"24% confuses the observed count with the percentage."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"40% تعادل 32 ظهوراً من 80.","En":"40% corresponds to thirty-two occurrences out of eighty."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"60% تعادل 48 ظهوراً.","En":"60% corresponds to forty-eight occurrences."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$النسبة المشاهدة هي التكرار النسبي مضروباً في مئة بالمئة.

$p_{\%}=\frac{k}{n}\cdot100\%,\quad n>0$

